  "adaptations": [
    "Keep copied native shirt/trouser surfaces and all skeleton, body, source paint, origins and attachments unchanged.",
    "Clip only the copied trouser waist, interpolating native bone weights.",
    "Paint braces, waistcoat, collar, pockets, buttons, folds, stitching and wear on garment surfaces instead of adding trim meshes.",
